<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank on Thursday announced sales of foreign exchange at its latest weekly auction held on Wednesday, July 2:</p>
<p>				     2 July	   25 June</p>
<p>Amount sold			$37.789 million    $41.483 million</p>
<p>Dollar exchange rate	   84.5 naira     85 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
